                "text": "It was a pleasure speaking at the American Medical Association\u2019s National Advocacy Conference. Our medical community is facing several challenges, especially with Medicare physician reimbursement.\n\nClick below to watch my remarks and Q&A.\n\nhttps://t.co/1ATLIGOWn9\n\nhttps://t.co/UiIeQyZ84Z",
