                "text": "My district team had the pleasure of meeting with Georgia Highlands Medical Services, a private non-profit community health center. As a physician, I know firsthand what it takes to care for others and am thankful for the care Georgia Highlands provides to the constituents of GA07. I am honored to have been awarded the Distinguished Community Health Center Advocate Award.",
