                "text": "I am thrilled that Fulton County named April Morehouse School of Medicine Month! As a proud alum and former student body president, Morehouse holds a special place in my heart. It's where I honed my skills as a physician and reinforced the importance of serving our community. Morehouse's commitment to excellence in medicine continues to inspire me every day!",
