                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I was incredibly impressed by the young innovators who won the Congressional App Challenge in my district. Their app, Plot AI, uses data analytics, photo imaging, and AI to help farmers monitor crop health, forecast yields, and diagnose diseases\u2014boosting efficiency and cutting costs.\n\nPlot AI stands out because it focuses on real-world farm management and its potential to impact more than one community.\n\nCongratulations to the team! I\u2019m excited to see where they take\u00a0Plot AI\u00a0next.",
