                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am proud to cosponsor the Wounded Warrior Bill of Rights Act of 2025! This legislation will enhance accountability and transparency for our brave service members going through medical separation. As a Marine and Navy veteran, I'm committed to ensuring our wounded warriors receive the fair and transparent evaluations they deserve. Let's stand up for those who have sacrificed so much for our nation.",
