                "text": "My bill, The PROTECTS Act of 2025, prohibits federal funds from being used to provide gender transition procedures to minors. As a physician and father, I will never stop fighting to protect all children by ensuring dangerous medical procedures are not funded by American taxpayers.\n\nhttps://t.co/UsFWnGqgut",
