                "text": "New week, new McCormick Minute!\nThis week, I have some critical updates:\n\ud83d\udcdcThe historic passage of the One Big Beautiful Bill\n\ud83e\ude7aOngoing concerns about transparency regarding President Biden\u2019s health\n\nAnd most importantly, I\u2019m praying for everyone impacted by the devastating floods in Texas. May God give you strength and comfort during this time.",
