                "text": "Today, I visited Grady Memorial Hospital Marcus Trauma Center\u2026 THE Trauma 1 Center for Atlanta and also where I was blessed to do my residency. There is no better place to learn about high acuity medicine in the world than Grady. \n\nIt was a great opportunity to learn more about their incredible partnership with the US Army. Grady trains trauma surgeons, medics, and Special Forces teams for the most challenging situations on the battlefield. Grateful for their lifesaving work and their commitment to our military!",
